      "value": "@{667353ba8663454809d39116|full_name}\n\n> ah, during that time yesterday there was unexpected load causing a backlog. Additional capacity has been added during the observed time now as a precaution and I'll be continuing to keep a close eye on it. In the case of a backlog something like increasing the processing wait time would not help unfortunately\n\nOK, if the load yesterday is very rare and temporal, it should be announced somewhere when your team detected, or after resolving issue, I think. Could you announce them publicly, please (in the future).\n\nI thought the load time is regular time and cause timeout in the future (when next performance rank calculation method is deployed).\n\nUnless we received some announce, we think it's permanent.",
