      "statusChangeID": "6762a6df9d338af2de0749f1",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "Closing this as based on discussion this was due to a temporary interruption and have heard no comments since stating other occurrences. An ongoing thing I've been doing since the latest major release is tuning this system to minimise the occurrence and time of the server processing step, I've made some progress however there's more I'd like (and plan) to do.\n\nIf anyone does experience any sort of abnormal avatar loading issue when making a post here on canny or messaging support please do include logs, a timestamp and avatar id (or avatar name + author). It really helps quickly diagnose what's might be going wrong, without most of that info it can be hard to investigate. Though I won't be able to really do much over the holidays I'll be continuing to keep an eye out for issues of this sort so they can be tackled quickly in the new year.",
