  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "**For Users**\n\nThis canny is about error avatar after very long \"Unpacking\".\n\nSince VRChat show waiting for server size (re) analysis as \"Unpacking\", it seem error avatar means unpacking avatar failed but actually server side analysis timeout.\n\nI made another canny about the incorrect message: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/unpacking-is-shown-while-server-side-avatar-reanalyzing-which-should-be-like-ana\n\n**Description of this problem**\n\nSorry I experienced this problem since Open Beta but I don't have enough time to write a canny so I write now.\n\nThe timeout time for waiting for server side avatar (re)analysis is too short as we may experience error avatar.\n\nIf the avatar is small & lightweight enough and the server is not jammed, no error avatar (with waiting several tens of seconds) but some relatively heavy avatar or server is jammed, we experience error avatar.\n\nI feel timeout for server side (re)analysis is too short",
